<title>ISRAEL: TENNIS-ISRAEL OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ISRAEL OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel Open quarter-finals on Friday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>4-Javier Sanchez (Spain) beat Javier Frana (Argentina) 6-2 3-6 6-3</p>
<p>Marcos Ondruska (South Africa) beat 5-Hernan Gumy (Argentina) 3-6 6-2 7-5</p>
<p>2-Albert Costa (Spain) beat 8-Scott Draper (Australia) 6-2 6-7 (1-7) 6-4</p>
<p>1-MaliVai Washington (U.S.) beat 7-Grant Stafford (South Africa) 4-6 7-6 (7-0) 6-4</p>
</text>
